.nf
usage: custodian tools run [\-h] tool ...

positional arguments:
  tool        Tool name (see: custodian tools list)
  kwargs      \-\-key value pairs passed to the tool

options:
  \-h, \-\-help  show this help message and exit
.fi
.SS custodian tools summary
.nf
usage: custodian tools summary [\-h]

options:
  \-h, \-\-help  show this help message and exit
.fi
.SS custodian adapters
.nf
usage: custodian adapters [\-h] {list,enable,disable,install,check} ...

Guard adapters run before and after every governed action. Built\-ins cover spend anomalies, prompt
injection, secret leaks, PII, context anchoring, loop breaking, tool confabulation, and scope
fencing. Local adapter files install hash\-pinned: if the file changes after install, it refuses to
load.

positional arguments:
  {list,enable,disable,install,check}
    list                List available and enabled adapters
    enable              Enable an adapter
    disable             Disable an adapter
    install             Install a local adapter file (hash\-pinned)
    check               Dry\-run the enabled pipeline against a sample action

options:
  \-h, \-\-help            show this help message and exit
.fi
